ts one server or skill, AgentTrust returns one endpoint decision and glc PromptGuard scores one prompt or tool output, and none joins agent to server to package to credential. firmy.ai MCP at https://firmy.ai/mcp is keyless Streamable HTTP, initialize 200 as firmy.ai 1.0.0, 8 tools listed and 6 called, get_account confirming mode free with authenticated false, the Polish registers behind a 22 section map that declares ready or missing before a section is asked for; driven on CD PROJEKT RED S.A. KRS 0000006865 with NIP 7342867148, REGON 492707333, entered 2001-04-06, 14 officers, 29 documents, 2024 revenue 985,030,000 PLN against 1,230,199,000 a fall of 19.9 percent, net income 469,874,000, EBITDA 379,785,000 and net margin 47.7 percent, sanctions verdict clear across EU and MSWiA as_of 2026-11-03, tenders not found since 2024-02-01 across BZP and TED also as_of 2026-11-03 while the profile page carried as_of 2026-08-10, and a revenue ranking from ORLEN at 294,976,000,000 PLN to Dino Polska at 25,658,552,000; two defects are recorded because driving found them, rank_companies returning up to 3,569,778.83 percent margin and 33,576.07 Altman points from near-zero denominators and search_companies returning regon null on every row while the dossier holds it, with a rejected section name handled well as INVALID_INPUT carrying the 22 valid sections and a suggested call; it earns a guide because Poland is the thin spot, company-atlas reading eight markets without it, UK Companies House and registry-mcp single jurisdictions, and Prometiam Risk covering thirteen European countries but pricing Polish financial statements at its Scale tier. Held with measurements: SnapEX Pay answered keyless as snapex-pay 1.0.1 with a session id and a remote endpoint beside npm and Docker packages under pro.snapex/pay, held on the agent-payments class carried by FiatDock and CoinVello; SheetsFinance returned 401 with protected-resource metadata and builds DCF, comps and dividend models as a li